    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a93b79464737b002f62dc5e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳、大海、还有我！　啊啊，全部都在发出耀眼的光芒！\n怒涛、织姬！　注意不要被我们的光芒灼伤了眼睛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c5c5473a8ea0d6b62eedb538f41b2310f2b6e38c6641a96a19ae662ed3889d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
