      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一想到乘客们会不会和那时的我想的一样，\n就变得这样，坐立不安的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2d9ec3be6a192359ba4c6f32feb157540f09c3fe9ac5781d93ed8ff210f477",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
