      "uid": "zhcn:7b1745b59e0611deb108a56a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想明白了。就算是下雨天，就算是不理想的旅行，\n我觉得『这也是一种美好的回忆』，想这样告诉大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5c697b1c8a7c0321dc41e7e442992b5a7c070de2d60cd59ee78fbad35048c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
